{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなぴょん*ଘ(੭*ˊᵕˋ)੭* ੈ✩‧₊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな元気ー？٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、今ずっとBABYMETALさんの曲を聴いててテンション高めです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、\nチームDがUSJ行ったりしてた間に\nあたしは別の用事＝\nベビメタちゃんのライブに行くという位ベビメタちゃんにハマってるのだよ。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃん家\nいつもありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビメタちゃん最高♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4の歌とメギツネとギミチョコ\nが特にお気に入りやよ( ⁼̴̀꒳⁼̴́ )ｯ✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、\n前にも増してファッションが好き。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、\nファーバッグと\nファーイヤリングをゲットしたよ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今季はファーアイテムが流行中、♡♡\n可愛い...♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファッションは\nLARMEとかSeventeenを\n参考にしてる～٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはPalmも毎号みてるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほかにも\n✩ViVi✩CUTiE✩ar\n✩チョキチョキガールズ✩popteem\n✩装苑✩Zipperあたりも毎月読んでる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと暇さえあれば雑誌読んでる！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5～19日までアンダーライブだ！\n(中に休演日もありますが、)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんから\n行くよー！頑張ってね！！とか\n当たんなかったけど応援してる！とか\n沢山握手会等で言われて凄く嬉しい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来られる方に楽しんもらえるよう一生懸命頑張ります♡今からドキドキだ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら当選しなかった方、、ぜひ次の機会があれば...待ってます...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん応援よろしくお願いします♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《LIVEに関して》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎掛け声はなんて言えばいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・「かわごー」で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(\"ひなぴょん\"にしてたのですが、聞こえずらい気がしたので今回のアンダーライブでは「かわごー」統一で♡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎サイリウムは何色？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"度々変えちゃってるので改めて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・生誕の持ってる人はそれで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・色というより\nハートネオンスティックが好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"または、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・赤のサイリウム"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【お知らせ】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《TV》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎6日「NOGIBINGO！3」放送スタート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎週見るしか٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶ ♥︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《雑誌》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎10日発売「MARQUEE」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くわしくはまたお話するね...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎「OVERTURE」発売中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほぼみんな載ってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなも出てるよ！\n創刊号で乃木を大特集してもらってありがたい..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/03/4710072/0014.j